OL,3,GNEWSANature spaces 'need to be next to
OL,4,Awhere people live'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople should not have to travel far to
OL,7,Fexperience the joys of nature,
OL,8,Fconservationists have said, as
OL,9,Fcampaigners push for more wildlife-rich
OL,10,Fgreen spaces in urban areas.
OL,12,FFrom Greater Manchester to north
OL,13,FLondon, organisations and volunteers
OL,14,Fare transforming former industrial land
OL,15,Fand neglected parks into habitats for
OL,16,Fwildlife and places for people to
OL,17,Fenjoy.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40302
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1790587558
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANature spaces 'need to be next to
OL,4,Awhere people live'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResearch suggests many people do not
OL,7,Fhave access to parks, woodlands or
OL,8,Fwetlands within a 15-minute walk of
OL,9,Ftheir home, despite evidence that time
OL,10,Fspent in nature can improve health and
OL,11,Fwellbeing.
OL,13,FStephen Cartwright, from the Lancashire
OL,14,FWildlife Trust, said: "We need the
OL,15,Fplaces right next to where people live,
OL,16,Fthat are scrappy bits of land."
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
